{"id": "swebq0106", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3508638758, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "what team did monta ellis get traded to?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0106.wav", "input_sha256": "220ed46b19d255efb2360ce8b613d588136a3d2973210ed5c4db74f67dec027c", "input_samples": 38620, "input_s": 2.414, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.7773, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Monta Ellis was traded to the Milwaukee Bucks from the Golden State Warriors in March 2012. (nba.com)", "expert_answer": "Monta Ellis was traded to the **Milwaukee Bucks** from the Golden State Warriors in March 2012. ([nba.com](https://www.nba.com/mavs/monta-ellis-signs-with-the-mavs?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What team did Monte Ellis get traded to?\n", "asr_s": 0.55, "expert_s": 4.86, "expert_input_samples": 38620, "expert_input_s": 2.414, "expert_input_sha256": "220ed46b19d255efb2360ce8b613d588136a3d2973210ed5c4db74f67dec027c", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.396, "relay_synth_ms": 3798, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 65, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 65, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0106_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "4de8b37b90c418073fb5f7304d4a239f4a8defd5a2d2b31975b4c302f8ab0a28", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 7.56}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0106_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "458d9f4dd18ddded3b172b7ee1b77ed1b4ab553eb66bc2ab98ecb00f9aec461e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0106_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "4f4e6d3b574613edb929dee1d4e9938b90f3a8db4bfb8ac44d9bacf6fc8dd337", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.88}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.062, 1.113, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.064, 2.114, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.414, 2.478, 2.529, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.414, 3.478, 3.947, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.414, 4.549, 4.967, 0, 21120, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.414, "last_real_feed_done": 2.478, "onset": 3.947, "gate_read_done": 3.947, "fire": 3.947, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.947, "stall_note": 3.948, "stall_first_pcm": 4.479, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.967, "expert_req": 3.948, "expert_resp": 9.363, "relay_synth_start": 9.363, "relay_first_pcm": 10.082, "relay_synth_end": 13.162, "first_any_pcm": 3.947, "first_answer_pcm": 10.082, "session_end": 13.288}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.669, "ttfa_any_s": 1.533}
{"id": "swebq0115", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1362359517, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "what countries speak english natively?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0115.wav", "input_sha256": "0cdb075a4f8c76c5d98fd98e531e39f7508d125b21338f28408c680719af91af", "input_samples": 31933, "input_s": 1.996, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.6416, "act": 0.9986, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Countries where English is a native language for a large share of the population and/or a primary national language include: United States , United Kingdom — England, Scotland, Wales, Northern Ireland , Ireland , Canada — especially outside Quebec , Australia , New Zealand English is also widely spoken natively in several Caribbean countries, including: Bahamas , Barbados , Belize , Jamaica ,.", "expert_answer": "Countries where **English is a native language for a large share of the population and/or a primary national language** include:\n\n- **United States**\n- **United Kingdom** — England, Scotland, Wales, Northern Ireland\n- **Ireland**\n- **Canada** — especially outside Quebec\n- **Australia**\n- **New Zealand**\n\nEnglish is also widely spoken natively in several **Caribbean countries**, including:\n\n- **Bahamas**\n- **Barbados**\n- **Belize**\n- **Jamaica**\n- **Trinidad and Tobago**\n- **Antigua and Barbuda**\n- **Saint Kitts and Nevis**\n- **Saint Lucia**\n- **Saint Vincent and the Grenadines**\n- **Grenada**\n- **Dominica**\n- **Guyana**\n\nThere are also countries where English is an official language and many people speak it fluently, but it is **not usually the native language of most citizens**, such as **India, Singapore, Nigeria, Ghana, Kenya, South Africa, the Philippines, and Pakistan**.", "transcript": "What countries speak English natively?\n", "asr_s": 0.54, "expert_s": 3.73, "expert_input_samples": 31933, "expert_input_s": 1.996, "expert_input_sha256": "0cdb075a4f8c76c5d98fd98e531e39f7508d125b21338f28408c680719af91af", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.573, "relay_synth_ms": 14807, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0115_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "e4a312189cde7cb5e64aa0de034719fa4ee0411b279ebf940740d3f57533cc86", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 31.64}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0115_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "f0292330d5306de5aae46ad5e2e1b1d90655615931c711eadc9c2be1fe34a7a6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0115_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "17f91ff55de397cce8b48fb977463fd9d0976759a264f225143ead13ae64c5b2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.061, 1.111, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.996, 2.059, 2.109, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.996, 3.06, 3.112, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.996, 4.06, 4.659, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 1.996, "last_real_feed_done": 2.059, "onset": 4.659, "gate_read_done": 4.659, "fire": 4.659, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.659, "stall_note": 4.66, "stall_first_pcm": 5.352, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.352, "expert_req": 4.659, "expert_resp": 8.925, "relay_synth_start": 8.926, "relay_first_pcm": 9.642, "relay_synth_end": 23.734, "first_any_pcm": 4.659, "first_answer_pcm": 9.642, "session_end": 23.9}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.646, "ttfa_any_s": 2.663}
{"id": "swebq0123", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2474443307, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "who was ptolemy and what did he do?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0123.wav", "input_sha256": "518170004f56ec07fb761b4466cd4bb63ccf37698b40456a285e124775b345be", "input_samples": 46793, "input_s": 2.925, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.4586, "act": 0.9968, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Ptolemy — full name Claudius Ptolemaeus — was a Greek-speaking scholar in Roman Egypt, active in Alexandria in the 2nd century CE. He is best known for his work in: Astronomy: He wrote the Almagest, which presented the Ptolemaic system: a geocentric model in which Earth was at the center of the universe and the Sun, Moon, planets, and stars moved around it. In short, Ptolemy was an ancient astronomer, mathematician, and geographer whose Earth-centered model of the cosmos shaped scientific thought for centuries.", "expert_answer": "**Ptolemy** — full name **Claudius Ptolemaeus** — was a **Greek-speaking scholar in Roman Egypt**, active in **Alexandria** in the **2nd century CE**.\n\nHe is best known for his work in:\n\n- **Astronomy:** He wrote the *Almagest*, which presented the **Ptolemaic system**: a geocentric model in which Earth was at the center of the universe and the Sun, Moon, planets, and stars moved around it. This model dominated astronomy in Europe and the Islamic world for over a thousand years.\n- **Geography:** His *Geography* compiled maps and coordinates of the known world and strongly influenced later cartography.\n- **Mathematics and optics:** He contributed to trigonometry, the study of light, vision, and planetary motion.\n- **Astrology:** His *Tetrabiblos* became one of the most influential ancient works on astrology.\n\nIn short, **Ptolemy was an ancient astronomer, mathematician, and geographer whose Earth-centered model of the cosmos shaped scientific thought for centuries.**", "transcript": "Who was Ptolemy, and what did he do?\n", "asr_s": 0.61, "expert_s": 4.29, "expert_input_samples": 46793, "expert_input_s": 2.925, "expert_input_sha256": "518170004f56ec07fb761b4466cd4bb63ccf37698b40456a285e124775b345be", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.643, "relay_synth_ms": 16121, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 398, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 398, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0123_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "17edbcb7de01ce2c48a8957f560c711f762c26ce2f149c5cf1d6875df3d43d19", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 32.2}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0123_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "b480a553d882e523534b37553595c1a9d3bf928ae2c5ea5bbf52bb364e96d4f2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0123_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "258c6db4217928a007b49edb1e6a31eec0b7313156d1835e9b845ab516162358", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.08}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.062, 1.112, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.064, 2.114, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.925, 2.99, 3.04, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.925, 3.989, 4.654, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.925, 5.385, 5.913, 0, 25920, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.925, "last_real_feed_done": 2.99, "onset": 4.654, "gate_read_done": 4.654, "fire": 4.654, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.654, "stall_note": 4.655, "stall_first_pcm": 5.323, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.913, "expert_req": 4.655, "expert_resp": 9.557, "relay_synth_start": 9.557, "relay_first_pcm": 10.272, "relay_synth_end": 25.678, "first_any_pcm": 4.654, "first_answer_pcm": 10.272, "session_end": 26.27